  "editorial": [
    "The four-page setting has 73 written 2/4 measures and no repeats. Its Moderato marking gives a quarter note of about 100.",
    "MIDI follows the printed pitch and note values, including the dotted-eighth and sixteenth pairs and 32 ties. Breath marks add no time.",
    "The file uses a GM recorder and uniform velocity for audition. Four MIDI channels keep written unisons and independent releases separate.",
    "Page markers are editorial locators. The last four parts release together halfway through bar 73 and the written rest remains.",
    "This is Kemp’s quartet setting of the corrido. The 1982 San Antonio polka is a separate recording reference."
